      "description": "Remotely control your Bambu Lab 3D printers, explore MakerWorld’s vast library of free models, and print your favorite designs with one tap！\n\nRemote Printer Control\n- Remotely operate the machine to start and stop printing whenever needed\n- Get real-time printing status and resolve errors promptly\n- Access to learning resources and step-by-step instructions to fix printing problems\n- High-resolution live view of the printing process\n- Automatic records of the printing process to help diagnose printing failures\n- Automatic timelapse video of the printing process to share with others\n\n3D Model Discovery with MakerWorld\n- Explore countless creative models and enjoy high-quality printing for free\n- Find trendy works and customize your unique models with MakerLab\n- Like, collect, and print in one tap to bring your ideas to life\n- Interact with makers and redeem credits for Bambu products\n\nBambu Handy is a free 3D printing platform. We are open to any feedback and suggestions. Whether you are an expert, hobbyist or newcomer, we would like to grow together with you. Contact: https://support.bambulab.com/en",
